# Static records map DB row IDs to names and are generated per-environment.
# Never bake a developer's locally-generated (dev DB) copies into the image —
# they are scaffolded with placeholders at build time and regenerated against
# the real DB after deploy. See scripts/generate/scaffold.ts.
configs/staticRecords/*
!configs/staticRecords/.gitkeep
